 addons/resource.language.en_gb/resources/strings.po       | 4 ++--
 .../language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po           | 4 ++--
 .../language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po           | 8 ++++----
 .../language/resource.language.es_es/strings.po           | 8 ++++----
 .../language/resource.language.es_mx/strings.po           | 8 ++++----
 system/settings/settings.xml                              | 4 ++--
 6 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/addons/resource.language.en_gb/resources/strings.po b/addons/resource.language.en_gb/resources/strings.po
index a28cc8d..3aca8fb 100644
--- a/addons/resource.language.en_gb/resources/strings.po
+++ b/addons/resource.language.en_gb/resources/strings.po
@@ -25342,13 +25342,13 @@ msgstr ""
 #. Hades: help of setting "videoscreen.hadeshdr420"; translated in Estuary (#31981)
 #: system/settings/settings.xml
 msgctxt "#39849"
-msgid "At 3840x2160 above 30 Hz, an HDMI 2.0 link, and an HDMI 2.1 one that the graphics card drives without FRL, carries RGB at 8 bits only, and HDR10 and HLG then lose two bits. In YCbCr 4:2:0 the same link carries 10 bits or more. The video is 4:2:0 already, so nothing of it is lost: only what is drawn over it (menus, subtitles) has half the colour resolution. Used only where the TV takes that mode in 4:2:0 with deep colour. Intel and AMD graphics; Dolby Vision is not affected. Applies from the next video."
+msgid "At 3840x2160 above 30 Hz, an HDMI 2.0 link, and an HDMI 2.1 one that the graphics card drives without FRL, carries RGB at 8 bits only, and HDR10 and HLG then lose two bits. In YCbCr the same link carries 10 bits or more: on AMD graphics in 4:2:2 at 12 bits where both the graphics and the TV take it, which keeps the colour of every line; otherwise in 4:2:0 where the TV takes that mode in 4:2:0 with deep colour, as on Intel graphics. The video is 4:2:0 already, so nothing of it is lost: only what is drawn over it (menus, subtitles) has less colour resolution. Dolby Vision is not affected. Applies from the next video."
 msgstr ""
 
 #. Hades: value of setting "videoscreen.hadeshdr420"; translated in Estuary (#31982)
 #: system/settings/settings.xml
 msgctxt "#39850"
-msgid "10-bit YCbCr 4:2:0"
+msgid "YCbCr, 10 bits or more"
 msgstr ""
 
 #. Hades: value of setting "videoscreen.hadeshdr420"; translated in Estuary (#31983)
